# Mainframe CICS & VSAM Application Portfolio

This document contains the complete set of Job Control Language (JCL), BMS Map Definition, and CICS COBOL Program source code for the **Skills & Details Inquiry Application (`MFRNMAPP`)**.

---

## 1. VSAM KSDS Cluster Definition (IDCAMS JCL)

```jcl
//TSOCP01X JOB 30000000,'ESK0 JOB CARD  ',MSGLEVEL=(1,1),               00010001
//    CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=Q,NOTIFY=&SYSUID,REGION=0M                       00020000
//******************************************************************
//* STEP 1: DEFINE VSAM KSDS FILE                                  *
//******************************************************************
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
  DELETE TSOCP01.ESK0G.SKILLS3 CLUSTER PURGE
  IF LASTCC <= 8 THEN SET MAXCC = 0

  DEFINE CLUSTER -
    (NAME(TSOCP01.ESK0G.SKILLS3) -
     CYLINDERS(1 1) -
     INDEXED -
     KEYS(4 0) -
     RECORDSIZE(240 240) -
     FREESPACE(10 10) -
     SHAREOPTIONS(2 3) -
     VOLUMES(SYSDA)) -
  DATA -
    (NAME(TSOCP01.ESK0G.SKILLS3.DATA)) -
  INDEX -
    (NAME(TSOCP01.ESK0G.SKILLS3.INDEX))
/*


